# {{lb|en|colloquial|often|childish}} Something that is [[forbidden]], [[prohibited]], [[discouraged]] or [[taboo]].
#: ''Smoking indoors is becoming a real '''no-no''' these days, in many places.''
# {{lb|en|baseball|colloquial}} A [[no-hitter]]; a game in which no batter on one of the teams got a [[hit]].
#: ''He threw two '''no-nos''' in his career.''

